; Edge timestamp capture ("logic analyser lite").
; Pushes the 16-bit timebase value at every rising and falling edge of in pin 0.
; The host reconstructs pulse widths from consecutive timestamps. Because T runs
; on the divided clock, the divider sets the capture resolution.
; Config: in_base = pin under test, in_shr=0, autopush off.
.program edge_capture
.wrap_target
    wait 1 pin 0
    in t, 16
    push
    wait 0 pin 0
    in t, 16
    push
.wrap
